      "Every format LinkedIn sells is in play: Sponsored Content across single image, carousel, video, document, event, and Connected TV; Sponsored Messaging in the inbox; Dynamic Ads; Text Ads; and Thought Leader Ads. Because our studio sits beside the media buyers, we test dozens of hooks and visual variants per campaign instead of starving the auction with three static banners.",
    ],
