    lead: 'Turn founders, executives, and subject-matter experts into your highest-trust distribution channel.',
    body: [
      "People on LinkedIn follow people before they follow logos. We optimize executive profiles and ghostwrite posts, articles, and document essays rooted in short monthly interviews, so every piece sounds unmistakably like the leader whose name is on it. When an organic post takes off, we promote it as a Thought Leader Ad in Campaign Manager to put paid reach behind a real human voice.",
      "For wider teams, we design and run structured Employee Advocacy programs, complete with profile makeovers, weekly sharing playbooks, and new-hire LinkedIn onboarding. And when your internal marketing or sales team wants to build the muscle in-house, we deliver hands-on workshops covering LinkedIn fundamentals, content creation, Campaign Manager advertising, and executive personal branding.",
    ],
    tags: [
      'Executive ghostwriting', 'Profile optimization', 'Thought Leader Ads',
      'Employee advocacy programs', 'Sales team playbooks', 'New-hire onboarding',
      'Team training workshops', 'Ads & content masterclasses',
    ],
