const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'What LinkedIn services do you provide?',
    a: 'Everything required to build brand authority and B2B pipeline on LinkedIn. We run six connected pillars: Company Page and editorial content management; LinkedIn Newsletters and Events; full-funnel LinkedIn Advertising and ABM media buying in Campaign Manager; Executive Personal Branding and ghostwriting; Employee Advocacy programs and hands-on team training; plus studio AIGC and brand-owned avatar video production. You can hire us for a single pillar or hand us the entire channel.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Do you manage the LinkedIn Ads media buying as well as the creative?',
    a: 'Yes. Our LinkedIn Advertising Certified buyers manage the entire Campaign Manager operation: funnel architecture, ABM company-list and job-title targeting, bidding, budget pacing, Insight Tag and Conversions API setup, native Lead Gen Forms, and CRM integration with HubSpot, Salesforce, or Pipedrive. Because our media buyers sit next to our studio team, we test dozens of creative variants per campaign and optimize toward qualified pipeline rather than surface clicks.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How do executive ghostwriting and Thought Leader Ads work together?',
    a: 'We start by optimizing the executive profile and running a short monthly interview to capture their real views on the industry. From there, we ghostwrite opinion posts, document essays, and video scripts in their voice. When an organic post earns strong engagement from your target buyers, we promote it directly in Campaign Manager as a Thought Leader Ad so your paid budget amplifies a trusted human voice.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What is included in your Employee Advocacy and Team Training programs?',
    a: 'For Employee Advocacy, we optimize employee profiles across leadership and commercial teams, build a repeatable weekly content-sharing playbook, onboard new hires, and track organic reach multiplication. For Team Training, we deliver customized half-day, full-day, or multi-week workshops on LinkedIn fundamentals, content creation, LinkedIn Ads in Campaign Manager, and executive personal branding.',
