  {
    q: 'How do you keep AI-assisted creative from looking generic or machine-made?',
    a: 'Every output goes through a human editorial and studio finishing pass. Copy is written and edited by B2B specialists. Layouts are set in your brand design system. Video is graded, and imagery is retouched with natural grain and color discipline. Nothing reaches your company page or Campaign Manager without a creative director signing it off.',
